      "extract": "arXiv:1904.05612v3 [math.OA] 27 Jul 2020 ON ORTHOGONAL SYSTEMS, TWO-SIDED BASES AND REGULAR SUBFACTORS KESHAB CHANDRA BAKSHI AND VED PRAKASH GUPTA Abstract. We prove that a regular subfactor of type II1 with ﬁnite Jones index always admits a two-sided Pimsner-Popa basis. This is preceded by a pragmatic revisit of Popa’s notion of orthogonal systems.",
